<title>UK: Quintain bid values Fiscal at 72.7p/shr.</title>
<headline>Quintain bid values Fiscal at 72.7p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Quintain Estates and Development Plc said on Thursday its agreed bid for Fiscal Properties Plc valued the company at 72.7p per share.</p>
<p>Quintain said it agreed to buy Fiscal and Croydon Land and Estates Ltd for a total of 77 million stg. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
